### Batch & Bulk Operations (DRY-RUN BY DEFAULT)

Always run `query_update_records` and `query_delete_records` with `confirm: false` first, then `confirm: true`.

| Tool | Description | Key Parameters |
|------|-------------|----------------|
| `batch_create_records` | Create multiple records | `operations` (array of {table, data, saveAs}) |
| `batch_update_records` | Update multiple records | `updates` (array of {table, sysId, data}) |
| `query_update_records` | Find and update matching | `table`, `query`, `data`, `confirm` |
| `query_delete_records` | Find and delete matching | `table`, `query`, `confirm` |

